            What is the problem with this approach?
            A) Making five changes at once is fine as long as the bug is gone.
            B) It is impossible to know which of the five changes fixed the bug, so
               the root cause is still unknown and the bug may reappear.  ← CORRECT
            C) Making multiple changes at once is the recommended strategy for
